{"id":205,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"In the moment that it gulps down its prey, the inside of its shell is exposed, but to this day, no one has ever seen that sight."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"When something approaches it, it fires off fragments of its steel shell in attack. This is not a conscious action but a conditioned reflex."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Forretress conceals itself inside its hardened steel shell. The shell is opened when the Pokémon is catching prey, but it does so at such a quick pace that the shell’s inside cannot be seen."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"games":["HeartGold"],"text":"Its entire body is shielded by a steel-hard shell. What lurks inside this shell is a total mystery."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Its entire body is shielded by a steel- hard shell. What lurks inside the armor is a total mystery."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It keeps itself inside its steel shell. The shell is opened when it is catching prey, but it is so quick that the shell’s inside cannot be seen."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Usually found hanging on to a fat tree trunk. It shoots out bits of its shell when it sees action."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sturdy","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon cannot be knocked out by a single hit as long as its HP is full. One-hit KO moves will also fail to knock it out."},{"name":"Overcoat","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon takes no damage from sandstorms. It is also protected from the effects of powders and spores."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"forest","color":"Purple","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":204,"name":"Pineco","condition":null,"children":[{"id":205,"name":"Forretress","condition":"Lv. 31","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,484],[1,33],[1,120],[1,182],[1,192],[1,390],[1,393],[1,450],[12,36],[17,229],[20,205],[23,174],[28,191],[32,371],[36,153],[42,334],[46,360],[50,38]],"machine":[776,34,450,405,523,174,91,38,529,414,89,203,263,430,202,416,356,360,912,484,270,63,861,334,442,113,679,319,220,398,884,182,240,115,156,179,350,157,317,328,201,402,214,684,76,191,446,796,444,522,164,241,129,36,851,86,390,474,521],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv10-140","name":"Forretress","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"140","artist":null,"img":"sv10/140"},{"id":"sv5-110","name":"Forretress","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"110","artist":"osare","img":"sv5/110"},{"id":"sv4pt5-2","name":"Forretress ex","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"2","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"sv4pt5/2"},{"id":"sv4pt5-212","name":"Forretress ex","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Ultra Rare","number":"212","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"sv4pt5/212"},{"id":"sv2-5","name":"Forretress ex","set":"Paldea Evolved","date":"2023-06-09","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"5","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"sv2/5"},{"id":"sv2-230","name":"Forretress ex","set":"Paldea Evolved","date":"2023-06-09","rarity":"Ultra Rare","number":"230","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"sv2/230"},{"id":"sv1-139","name":"Forretress","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"139","artist":"Lee HyunJung","img":"sv1/139"},{"id":"swsh4-114","name":"Forretress","set":"Vivid Voltage","date":"2020-11-13","rarity":"Rare","number":"114","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","img":"swsh4/114"},{"id":"sm8-124","name":"Forretress","set":"Lost Thunder","date":"2018-11-02","rarity":"Rare","number